meta {
  name: 4. Get Content File
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/content/{{contentId}}/file
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Telegram-Init-Data: {{initData}}
}

docs {
  The actual file bytes — for an item with no spoiler this just shows it
  directly; for a spoiler item this IS the "tap to reveal" action (the
  frontend shows a generic spoiler overlay without calling this at all
  until tapped). For a free spoiler this always succeeds. For a paid one
  without a purchase, expect 402 with {"reason": "payment_required",
  "price_stars": N} — run "5. Purchase Content" first to unlock it, then
  retry this.
}
